  <h1>Visualizer Effects: 130+ Audio Visualizations, Multi-Layer &amp; Beat Reactions in Your Browser</h1>

  <div class="blog-meta">
    <span class="blog-meta-badge">Feature Guide</span>
    <span>September 21, 2026</span>
    <span>· 7 min read</span>
  </div>

  <p>
    An audio visualizer is only as good as its effects. The KodiniTools Audio Visualizer ships more than 130 of them: classic spectrum bars, pulsing rings, light rays, tunnels, mandalas, stage lights, lasers, fireworks and northern lights. Most effects run as GPU presets via WebGL directly on your graphics card, can be stacked as layers and react to bass, mids, treble or only to the beat. This guide walks through the effect families, shows how to combine them and how to export the result as a video.
  </p>

