    />
    <figcaption>Flight into depth: tunnel effects like "Tunnel", "Laser Tunnel" and "Honeycomb Tunnel" pull the viewer into the image, the speed follows the bass.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <p>
    "Tunnel" flies through a twisting, noise-textured tube that twists on every onset. "Honeycomb Tunnel" lines the tube with hexagons that light up per frequency band. "Stargate" stacks concentric rings of glowing segments, each rotating at its own speed and direction. For outer space there are "Warp Stars" with hyperspace streaks, "Galaxy" with rotating spiral arms and "Particle Storm" with thousands of particles that burst outward on every beat. "Neon Grid" delivers the synthwave floor with a striped sun on the horizon.
  </p>

  <h3>Mandala, Fractals and Geometry</h3>

  <figure class="blog-demo">
    <img
      src="/image/visualizer-blog-4.png"
      alt="Audio visualizer mandala effect: green glowing kaleidoscopic flower shape with several rings and a bright centre on a black background"
